"|lPr){^{Af-xhv^,QHLr\">playerAnswer</variable></variables><block type=\"function_definition\" x=\"1117\" y=\"-207\"><mutation name=\"getAndDisplayPlayerName\" functionid=\"f/yMxBA,mM}a2#,T1Y}8\"></mutation><field name=\"function_name\">getAndDisplayPlayerName</field><comment pinned=\"true\" h=\"402\" w=\"370\">This code uses the \"settings\" extension to permanently store the players's name.\n\nAn if block checks to see if the setting already exists:\n\n- IF it does, it retrieves the value from settings\n\n- ELSE it asks the player to enter their name\n\nAfter the IF block, a simple Hello message is displayed which combines text with the \"name\" variable.</comment><data>{\"commentRefs\":[],\"fieldData\":{\"~commentOffsetX\":\"-409.55555555555554\",\"~commentOffsetY\":\"-22.888888888888886\"}}</data><statement name=\"STACK\"><block type=\"controls_if\"><mutation else=\"1\"></mutation><value name=\"IF0\"><shadow type=\"logic_boolean\"><field name=\"BOOL\">TRUE</field></shadow><block type=\"block_settings_exists\"><value name=\"name\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">name</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name=\"DO0\"><block type=\"variables_set\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"RHS}akw79O$=ZVwMF$]_\">name</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><shadow type=\"math_number\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></shadow><block type=\"block_settings_read_string\"><value name=\"name\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">name</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></statement><statement name=\"ELSE\"><block type=\"variables_set\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"RHS}akw79O$=ZVwMF$]_\">name</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><shadow type=\"math_number\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></shadow><block type=\"gameaskforstring\"><mutation xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" _expanded=\"0\" _input_init=\"true\"></mutation><value name=\"message\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">What is your name?</field></shadow></value><value name=\"answerLength\"><shadow type=\"math_number_minmax\"><mutation min=\"1\" max=\"24\" label=\"AnswerLength\" precision=\"0\"></mutation><field name=\"SLIDER\">12</field></shadow></value><value name=\"useOnScreenKeyboard\"><shadow type=\"logic_boolean\"><field name=\"BOOL\">FALSE</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type=\"block_settings_write_string\"><value name=\"name\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">name</field></shadow></value><value name=\"value\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\"></field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"RHS}akw79O$=ZVwMF$]_\">name</field></block></value></block></next></block></statement><next><block type=\"gameSplash\"><mutation xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" _expanded=\"0\" _input_init=\"true\"></mutation><value name=\"title\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\"></field></shadow><block type=\"text_join\"><mutation items=\"3\"></mutation><value name=\"ADD0\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">Hello, </field></shadow></value><value name=\"ADD1\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">World</field></shadow><block type=\"variables_get\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"RHS}akw79O$=ZVwMF$]_\">name</field></block></value><value name=\"ADD2\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">!</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name=\"subtitle\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\"></field></shadow></value></block></next></block></statement></block><block type=\"pxt-on-start\" x=\"-2040\" y=\"-17\"><comment pinned=\"true\" h=\"583\" w=\"370\">This code uses the code for the previous tutorials, placing the code neatly in functions:\n- getAndDisplayPlayerName\n- welcomeToOzHarvest\n- calculateNumberOfHungryStudents\n\nTo make this easier to test, you can simply drag the function blocks outside the start block to test other code on its own.\n\nNow it's your turn to create your own learning activity. Remember that we have learnt how to:\n- Ask for a player's name and store it in a setting