 code uses the \"settings\" extension to permanently store the players's name.\n\nAn if block checks to see if the setting already exists:\n\n- IF it does, it retrieves the value from settings\n\n- ELSE it asks the player to enter their name\n\nAfter the IF block, a simple Hello message is displayed which combines text with the \"name\" variable.</comment><data>{\"commentRefs\":[],\"fieldData\":{\"~commentOffsetX\":\"-409.55555555555554\",\"~commentOffsetY\":\"-22.888888888888886\"}}</data><statement name=\"STACK\"><block type=\"controls_if\"><mutation else=\"1\"></mutation><value name=\"IF0\"><shadow type=\"logic_boolean\"><field name=\"BOOL\">TRUE</field></shadow><block type=\"block_settings_exists\"><value name=\"name\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">name</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name=\"DO0\"><block type=\"variables_set\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"RHS}akw79O$=ZVwMF$]_\">name</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><shadow type=\"math_number\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></shadow><block type=\"block_settings_read_string\"><value name=\"name\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">name</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></statement><statement name=\"ELSE\"><block type=\"variables_set\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"RHS}akw79O$=ZVwMF$]_\">name</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><shadow type=\"math_number\"><field name=\"NUM\">0</field></shadow><block type=\"gameaskforstring\"><mutation xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" _expanded=\"0\" _input_init=\"true\"></mutation><value name=\"message\"><shadow type=\"text\"><field name=\"TEXT\">What is your name?</field></shadow></value><value name=\"answerLength\"><shadow type=\"math_number_minmax\"><mutation min=\"1\" max=\"24\" label=\"AnswerLength\" precision=\"0\"></mutation><field name=\"SLIDER\">12</field></shadow></value><value name=\"useOnScreenKeyboard\"><shadow type=\"logic_boolean\"><field name=\"BOOL\">FALSE</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type=\"block_sett